  "title": "L&T and Nokia Expand Partnership in India for R&D",
  "summary": "L&T Technology Services and Nokia have signed a five-year contract to support engineering and R&D in India, with the agreement including the establishment of a dedicated offshore development center in India. The center will focus on 5G networks, AI-driven operations, software development, and next-generation telecom infrastructure.",
  "facts": [
    {
